    "created_at": "2022-06-15T13:35:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-15T13:35:54Z",
    "body": "There is currently some [Gecko code for `<param>` in `nsObjectLoadingContent`](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/2398ab33adcea896838b3da678ff6480dbb98b9a/dom/base/nsObjectLoadingContent.cpp#423-532).  That said, I think the exposure of the results of this code [on `HTMLObjectElement` and `HTMLEmbedElement`](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/2398ab33adcea896838b3da678ff6480dbb98b9a/dom/webidl/HTMLObjectElement.webidl#125-126) is [`[ChromeOnly]`](https://firefox-source-docs.mozilla.org/dom/webIdlBindings/index.html#chromeonly).",
